      "content": "those \"small actions\" feel like a joke. what’s the point of a tiny ripple when the ocean is just toxic? everyone i knew is gone, i have no way to move forward, and the people who actually matter are the ones who broke everything. it feels like there's just no space left for someone like me in this world. everything is just heavy and hollow. i don't even see a future anymore, just this endless, exhausting cycle of trying to exist in a place that clearly doesn't want me.",
